 era, stranded and alone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/VortexGif1.gif?t=1742666277\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>With each era he traverses, the amulet reveals its connection to the Ark of the Covenant, glowing near artifacts tied to his family\u2019s legacy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>As Ethan edges closer to the Ark\u2019s true resting place, he faces a powerful choice: expose its secrets to the world or keep them hidden to protect humanity. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ethan\u2019s journey isn\u2019t just about finding his way home it\u2019s about understanding the timeless threads that connect us all.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>\u201cWe all share the same roots. We are all one.\u201d</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/Run1.gif?t=1742666277\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/Mechanics1.png?t=1742666277\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/Time1.png?t=1742666277\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Experience hand-crafted historical eras, each with deep lore, living NPCs, and game-changing decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/Combat.png?t=1742666277\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in visceral melee and ranged combat inspired by legendary warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/Reverse.png?t=1742666277\" />Rewind key moments, correct mistakes, and explore alternate outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/Explore.png?t=1742666277\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover ancient cities, hidden temples, and war-torn battlefields in cinematic detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/Puzzle.png?t=1742666277\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decipher ancient texts, unlock hidden chambers, and recover lost artifacts.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/Choice.png?t=1742666277\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your actions alter alliances, reshape historical events, and impact your legacy.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/Replayability.png?t=1742666277\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> No two journeys are the same different choices lead to unique outcomes and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time is fragile. <strong>Will you protect the past, or watch it fall apart?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539330/extras/Timeline.png?t=1742666277\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can You Find Your Way Home Without Breaking History?\u00a0</strong>Every hero needs help. Every moment counts. And history doesn\u2019t always go as planned. <strong>Will you preserve the timeline or become its greatest threat?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["C1 Innovations"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"descript